<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div align="center" style=""><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA82DD0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA81B00"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA80830"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA80A90" style="line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA80CF0" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA80F50"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD02030"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD030B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD031E0" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD02E50"><tr width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD02F80"><td align="center" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD02160" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 60px; width: 680px;"><div data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD02290" style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD02D20" style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Earn Points. Save on Flights. Manage Travel</font></div><div data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD02AE0" style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD029B0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD02880"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD02750"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD02620" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/home.html" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/QBR_eDM_Banner.jpg" title="Qantas Business Rewards" style="width: 680px;"></font></a></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD023C0" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA88CE0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA87A10"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA86740" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA869A0"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA86C00"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA86E60"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA805D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA82450"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA84160" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA83A80"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA82B70" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA844F0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA826B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you for your time earlier. It was great getting to know you and learning more about your business. As promised, I'm sharing further information regarding the benefits of your Qantas Business Rewards membership.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA83730"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA83840">This information can be shared in the Business to help inform your Travellers on the best ways to book to ensure you can extract the most value for the business.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA83E10"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA83F20">I appreciate you raising&nbsp;<mark data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA82910">XXX</mark>&nbsp;during our call. I have looked into this for you and found&nbsp;<mark data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCCF2A0">XXX</mark>. If you require further assistance with this, please let me know.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA87310"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA87DA0">As we covered in our call, below is an overview of the key areas we discussed to support the Business and Travellers to book through Qantas Business Rewards and earn benefits:</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCCF500"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCCF760" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA864E0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA88360" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA885C0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA88820"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA88A80" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA89E30"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA89600"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA89BD0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/qbr-icon-business-account-48x48.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA89070" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA8A550" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA892B0"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA8A1C0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA8B7D0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA8AC50"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCFC000" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><h3 data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCFBED0" style="font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px; font-weight: 400; margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Ways to book</font></h3><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCFC260"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCFBDA0">Business Account</strong>&nbsp;- When booking through your Qantas Business Rewards Account, your ABN will automatically be added. Don’t forget to also add the traveller’s Frequent Flyer number, or store your travellers to save time.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCFC370"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCFC480"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCFC590">Qantas.com or Qantas app</strong>&nbsp;– If you and your team have been added as a stored traveller to your Business Account, you’ll be able to book via qantas.com or the Qantas app. Remember to turn the toggle on to indicate you are traveling for business to ensure your ABN is added.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCFC6C0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCFC7D0"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCFC8E0">Your Travel Agent</strong>&nbsp;– If you book through a travel agent, you can still access your member flight savings and earn points. Make sure your travel agent adds your business’ ABN and the traveller’s Qantas Frequent Flyer number to all bookings. The Qantas Business Rewards Agent Toolkit can be passed on to your travel agent as a reminder of how to book to access your benefits. Find it&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qac/qbr/qbr-agent-toolkit-aug2024.pdf" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCFC130" style="color: rgb(223, 0, 0); border: 0px;">here</a>.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA8B570"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD01A40" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD01800"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD016D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" height="50px" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD015A0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD01470"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD01340" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD01210"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD010E0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015523C60" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; height: 50px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/icon-points.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CA8B330" style="margin: 0px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015521540" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCCC820"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000155237A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015523A00"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCD0310"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCCF040" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><h3 data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCCEDE0" style="font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px; font-weight: 400; margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Stored traveller</font></h3><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCCFC10">A stored traveller is someone who flies regularly for work and is added to a company’s Qantas Business Rewards Account to make booking more efficient. If the Traveller books for themselves, once you add them as a Stored Traveller and enable self-booking, they will be able to book and manage their own flights via qantas.com or the Qantas app. Plus, they can access benefits including member flight savings and earn more points for themselves and for the business.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCD06A0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCD1970"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCD1BB0">Adding a Stored Traveller</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCF0680"></font><ol data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCD15E0" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px;"><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCD0C60" style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">From the Business Account, however over your business name and select ‘Manage Travellers’ from the dropdown.</font></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCD1F40" style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">In the ‘Travellers’ tab, select ‘Add a traveller’ and fill in the traveller’s details.</font></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCD1380" style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Enable self-booking for the traveller.</font></li></ol><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015527E00"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCD1120">How to book as a stored traveller</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015527CF0">Once the traveller has been added to the Business Account as a stored traveller with self-booking enabled, you can provide this information to them allowing them to book through their Frequent Flyer account.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015527AB0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000155279A0"></font><ol data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BCD0EC0" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px;"><li data_liveedit_tagid="00000000155217A0" style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Log into your Frequent Flyer account on qantas.com or the Qantas app, and open ‘Book a Trip’.</font></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015521A00" style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Select the “I’m travelling for” business toggle.</font></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015528040" style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Access exclusive member flight savings ~ and earn more Qantas points for yourself<sup data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015526DC0" style="font-size: 9px; line-height: 8px;">#</sup>&nbsp;and for the business.<sup data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015528D10" style="font-size: 9px; line-height: 8px;">±</sup></font></li></ol><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001544FC20"><em data_liveedit_tagid="00000000155274E0">Further information on stored travellers can be found in our&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/news/how-to-guides/stored-travellers.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001552A260" style="color: rgb(223, 0, 0); border: 0px;">how-to-guide</a>.</em></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001552A4C0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001552D6D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001552CFF0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD00E80" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD00FB0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD01B70"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD01CA0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001544F040"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD01DD0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD01F00" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/flyer-bonus-icon.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001544EE00" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001544E710" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001544ECF0"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001544F890" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015525C10"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015525E70"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015520240" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><h3 data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015526900" style="font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px; font-weight: 400; margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Flyer bonus</font></h3><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD01930">250 bonus Qantas Points per booking for Frequent Flyers<sup data_liveedit_tagid="000000001551FFE0" style="font-size: 9px; line-height: 8px;">+</sup>, every time they fly for work, on top of the points and Status Credits they already earn.<sup data_liveedit_tagid="00000000155204A0" style="font-size: 9px; line-height: 8px;">#</sup></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000155746E0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015574940" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001558A7B0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015587470" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Some helpful links are listed below which we recommend saving for quick and easy navigation:</font><ul data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015585460" style="margin: 5px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1px;"><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001558A550" style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/qbr/myaccount" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000155876D0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Your Qantas Business Rewards Account</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001558AC70" style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/earn-points-and-save-on-flights.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001558AED0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Business Rewards flying benefits</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015588AC0" style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/manage-travel/travel-fund.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015587210" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Get familiar with Travel Fund</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015589530" style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/qbr/qantas-club" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015588E50" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Business Rewards exclusive Qantas Club discount</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015585920" style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/earn-points-on-business-expenses.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000155844F0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Earn points on business expenses through our 50+ partners</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015585200" style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/news/how-to-guides/stored-travellers.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000155849B0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">How to make the most out of the stored traveller feature</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015584E70" style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/news/how-to-guides.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015585B80" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Business Rewards How-To Guides</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015584C10" style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/faqs.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015574480" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Business Rewards FAQs</font></a></li></ul><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015589D20">If you have a query, please feel free to contact me by calling 13 10 85, or you can speak to the Qantas Business Rewards Service Centre on 13 74 78. I look forward to speaking with you again soon.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015589C10"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000155899D0">Kind regards,<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000155892F0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000155891E0"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015574E00">{!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015587DD0">{!User.Title}<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015587CC0"><em data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015575060">Qantas Business Rewards</em></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000155659A0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015565AD0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015565E60"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015565F90" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015566320"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001556B5D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><img border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/images/why-fly-qantas-24.png" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015582B10" style="width: 600px; display: block;"></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001556B830"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001556F710" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001556F970"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001556FBD0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 9px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 12px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">1. Selected featured content may not be available on your flight. Inflight entertainment varies by route and aircraft.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015575C40"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015568160">2. Meals, beverages, entertainment offerings vary between flight times. Alcohol offered during select flight times on select flights.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015563170"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015561EA0">3. Qantas Club membership and access is subject to the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/the-qantas-club/terms-conditions.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015574BA0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">terms and conditions</a>&nbsp;of the Qantas Club.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015561410"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001555E020">4. The number of destinations is correct as at 5 February 2024, but is subject to change.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001555C9B0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001555C8A0">5. You must be a member of the Qantas Frequent Flyer program to earn and redeem Qantas Points. A joining fee may apply. Membership and Qantas Points are subject to the Qantas Frequent Flyer program terms and conditions.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001556F4B0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001556F250" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001556B110"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015566450" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015567290"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015566CA0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001556C130" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001556AEB0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000155654E0"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015565610" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015584290" style="font-size: 10px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015559C40"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015559EA0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001552FA50" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000155599E0"><td align="center" valign="top" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015560F60" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015560840" style="margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015560AA0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015562DE0"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015561B10" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/Qantas/" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000155646A0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img border="0" height="22" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/facebook.png" title="Facebook" width="40" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001555C660"></a><a href="https://twitter.com/Qantas" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015564900" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: n